<section id="fn-group1" class="fn-group"><div class="fn-group p font-secondary-light font-sm">
<div class="fn p" id="fn1"><p>Supplemental Material is available online (<a href="https://doi.org/10.1289/EHP13644" class="usa-link usa-link--external" data-ga-action="click_feat_suppl" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">https://doi.org/10.1289/EHP13644</a>).</p></div>
